        <li>MS Dept. of Revenue — <a href="https://www.dor.ms.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">dor.ms.gov</a> (retirement exemption, homestead)</li>
        <li>HB 1 (2025) income-tax phase-down — AARP MS tax guide / NTU analysis</li>
        <li>Related on this site: <a href="/guides/ms-homestead-exemption">Homestead exemption</a> · <a href="/guides/coastal-ms-flood-zones">Flood zones</a> · <a href="/relocation">Relocation guide</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="sources-note"><strong>Drafted July 2026.</strong> Tax rates and exemptions change — verify current-year rules before relying on them.</p>
    </aside>

  </main>

</SiteLayout>

